// Radiant damage plus a "next attack against this target lands more easily"
// rider, modeled with the existing `FaerieFire` BuffKind (already shipped as
// a flat evasion penalty on the target -- see faerie_fire.ron/hex_evasion.ron,
// the latter applying it via this exact same BasicRanged projectile-buff
// shape). Duration kept short (6s, vs hex_evasion's dedicated 60s debuff)
// since this is a minor rider on a nuke, not the spell's whole purpose --
// mirrors D&D's own "until the end of your next turn" framing.
BasicRanged(
    energy_cost: 30,
    buildup_duration: 0.4,
    recover_duration: 0.3,
    projectile: (
        kind: Simple,
        attack: Some((
            damage: 20,
            buff: Some((
                kind: FaerieFire,
                dur_secs: 6,
                strength: Value(0.3),
                chance: 1.0,
            )),
            damage_kind: Radiant,
        )),
    ),
    projectile_body: Object(BoltFire),
    projectile_speed: 60.0,
    num_projectiles: Value(1),
    meta: (school: Some(Evocation), source: Some(Divine)),
)
